diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index dfb9d3d..acd069d 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,8 +6,12 @@ A small client and CLI for the items API.
 
 ```text
 python3 -m pkg list
+python3 -m pkg --retries 5 list
 ```
 
+`--retries` sets how many times a request is retried after a server error
+(default 2, so up to 3 attempts). `--retries 0` disables retrying.
+
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
 
 ## Sizes
